commit: 6c81a52
learnings:
  - The inline studio app is a TS string returned by getInlineApp() and is NOT typechecked by tsc (it is a string literal) — verify client-side edits by actually booting the studio and fetching the Vite-transpiled /main.ts
  - which surfaces real syntax/transpile errors that tsc misses. macOS has no 'timeout' command; use background process + sleep + lsof-kill for transient server smoke tests.
